</ul>
<hr/><ul>
<li class="ch">在一片广阔的草地上，一群Q版风格的动物朋友正在举行一场盛大的野餐聚会。长颈鹿戴着太阳镜在分发零食，小松鼠在树桩上演奏小提琴，还有跳着踢踏舞的企鹅。画面采用了柔和的色彩渲染，呈现出治愈系的日式动漫风格。背景是蓝天白云和竞相开放的野花，构图广阔且充满细节，强调角色间的互动与友谊，光线柔和细腻，仿佛置身于一个童话般的乌托邦世界，极具视觉冲击力与艺术感。</li>
<li class="en">On a vast meadow, a group of Q-version animal friends are holding a grand picnic party. A giraffe wearing sunglasses is handing out snacks, a small squirrel is playing the violin on a stump, and penguins are performing a tap dance. The image uses soft color rendering, presenting a healing Japanese anime style. The background features a blue sky with white clouds and blooming wildflowers, with a wide composition full of details that emphasize interaction and friendship among characters. The lighting is soft and delicate, making it feel like a fairy-tale utopia, with strong visual impact and artistic flair.</li>
</ul>
<hr/><ul>
