<li class="en">A lively late-night forest ball featuring a group of anthropomorphic woodland animals. They are dressed in exquisite evening gowns and suits, dancing joyfully under the glow of fireflies. A hedgehog wears a small party dress, an owl conducts the orchestra, and a raccoon serves delicious drinks. The image uses 3D rendering effects, showcasing fine textures in a Pixar style. The background is a deep, mysterious forest dotted with glowing mushrooms and magical light spots, with sparkling dust floating in the air, creating a fantastical, lively, and festive visual feast.</li>
